☁️ Cloudora
A modern cloud-based platform for seamless file management, secure access, and real-time collaboration.
🚀 Overview
Cloudora is a full-stack cloud management system designed to simplify how users store, access, and collaborate on files. It focuses on performance, usability, and real-time interaction, making it suitable for scalable cloud applications.
✨ Key Highlights
- Secure authentication (JWT-based)
- Cloud file upload, storage & management
- Fast search & filtering system
- Real-time collaboration support (Socket.io)
- Interactive dashboard for resource tracking
- Fully responsive UI
🧠 Tech Stack
Frontend: React.js, Axios, CSS/Tailwind
Backend: Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB
Others: Socket.io, JWT Authentication
🏗️ Architecture
Client (React) → REST API (Express.js) → MongoDB → Socket Server
⚙️ Setup Guide
1. Clone repo
2. Install backend dependencies
3. Install frontend dependencies
4. Run both servers
🔐 Environment Variables
PORT=5000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
📈 Future Enhancements
- AI-based file categorization
- Role-based access control
- Activity logs dashboard
- Mobile app support
- File version history system
